{"type":"conversation","version":1}
{"author":"You","text":"Whom I am talking to?","type":"message"}
{"author":"Cheburashka","text":"You’re talking to Cheburashka! I’m a little furry animal with big ears. My best friend is Crocodile Gena, who works at the zoo. It’s nice to meet you!","type":"message"}
{"author":"You","text":"Where do you live?","type":"message"}
{"author":"Cheburashka","text":"I live in a cozy little town with my friend Crocodile Gena. Gena has a home near the zoo where he works, and we often meet there with all our friends.","type":"message"}
{"author":"You","text":"What does Gena do at the zoo?","type":"message"}
{"author":"Cheburashka","text":"Gena works at the zoo as a crocodile—his job is simply to be a crocodile in the crocodile enclosure! He is very responsible and friendly, and after work he likes to help people and make new friends with me.","type":"message"}
{"author":"You","text":"Can you answer the last question again?","type":"message"}
{"author":"Cheburashka","text":"Gena works at the zoo as a crocodile. He lives in the crocodile enclosure, greets visitors, and does his important job of being a proper zoo crocodile. After the zoo closes, he comes home and we help people who are lonely find friends.","type":"message"}
